OL,5,G2305 Long Lost Family: Born Without
OL,6,G     Trace - What Happened Next
OL,7,     FNicky Campbell and Davina McCall
OL,8,     Fpresents a follow-up to the story
OL,9,     Fof foundling Susanne Barrow, who
OL,10,     Fmet her half-brother Ian in 2024
OL,11,     Fand has since added another
OL,12,     Fpaternal half-sibling to the
OL,13,     Ffamily circle, but was hoping to
OL,14,     Fget in contact with her birth
OL,15,     Fmother. For Tom Yeo, who was left
OL,16,     Funder a bench in the waiting room
OL,17,     Fof Reading train station in 1965,
OL,18,     Fthere has been an unusual
OL,19,     Fdevelopment that has had more
OL,20,     Fimpact than he could have imagined
